day, May 31 Juneteenth (Observed): Friday, June 18 Independence Day (Observed): Monday, July 5 Labor Day: Monday, September 6 Thanksgiving Holiday: Wednesday-Friday, November 24-26 Winter Break: Monday-Friday, December 20-24 Monday-Friday, December 27-31 Work at LR Benefits Summary TimelyCare Virtual Health & Wellbeing Faculty & Staff Holidays Human Resources Get Info Visit Apply Deposit Return to home Find us on Facebook Subscribe on YouTube Follow us on Instagram 625 7th Ave NE, Hickory, NC 28601 828.328.1741 Directory Virtual Tour, Maps & Directions Events Calendar University News Profile Magazine Work at LR Library Bookstore Copyright Privacy Policy Accessibility Title IX Safety & Emergency Preparedness Consumer Information Coronavirus © 2026 Lenoir-Rhyne University"
